{
  "slug": "altimate-code",
  "name": "Altimate Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Delegates dbt and warehouse work to altimate-code, a specialized CLI agent with 100+ purpose-built data tools (SQL analysis, column-level lineage, dbt build/test/run, warehouse profiling, FinOps, connectivity to Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, Databricks, Postgres, MySQL, DuckDB).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `altimate-code` (Delegates dbt and warehouse work to altimate-code, a specialized CLI agent with 100+ purpose-built data tools), `review` (Review dbt project changes — dbt models (models/**/*.sql), schema.yml, dbt_project.yml, sources.yml, macros, snapshots, seeds)\n- **Commands** (2): `altimate` (Delegate a task to altimate-code, the specialised data-engineering CLI agent (warehouse access, column-level lineage, cross-DB, FinOps, query optimization)), `review` (Run the altimate-code dbt/SQL PR reviewer on the current diff, PR, or commit and present the signed verdict…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install altimate-code@claude-plugins-official` from `AltimateAI/altimate-claude-plugin` (`plugins/altimate-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
